For students below C+, comprehensively explore the applicable diploma, certificate, artisan, and other pathways using verified entry criteria.

Where a student qualifies for several different qualification levels, allow them to explore all of them.

Do not automatically replace an academically qualifying diploma or certificate option with a degree recommendation, or vice versa.

